    },
    {
      "text": "Chrysippus further integrated these ideas into Stoic logic, emphasizing semantic paradoxes and the role of modalities in propositional inferences",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Logic",
      "agent": "further"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chrysippus further integrated these ideas into Stoic logic, emphasizing semantic paradoxes and the role of modalities in propositional inferences",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Logic",
