    {
      "text": "The story critiques unchecked secular rationalism through Dr",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Dracula",
      "agent": "story"
    },
    {
      "text": "This arc mirrors late Victorian debates on miracles and materialism, where empirical doubt yields to experiential vindication of orthodoxy without resolving into metaphor",
