    },
    {
      "text": "Philosophers sought universal principles derivable from human nature or reason, influencing modern ethics by prioritizing individual agency and empirical observation in moral judgments",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Ethics",
      "agent": "reason"
    },
    {
      "text": "Philosophers sought universal principles derivable from human nature or reason, influencing modern ethics by prioritizing individual agency and empirical observation in moral judgments",
