      "agent": "reason"
    },
    {
      "text": "This era's developments laid groundwork for deontology , utilitarianism , and sentimentalism, challenging prior theological dominance while grappling with skepticism about absolute moral knowledge",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Ethics",
      "agent": "groundwork"
    },
    {
      "text": "This era's developments laid groundwork for deontology , utilitarianism , and sentimentalism, challenging prior theological dominance while grappling with skepticism about absolute moral knowledge",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Ethics",
      "agent": "groundwork"
    },
    {
      "text": "This rationalist framework demanded autonomy \u2014self-legislation through reason\u2014rejecting heteronomy from inclinations or empirical desires, and formed a cornerstone of modern duty-based ethics",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Ethics",
      "agent": "framework"
    },
    {
      "text": "This rationalist framework demanded autonomy \u2014self-legislation through reason\u2014rejecting heteronomy from inclinations or empirical desires, and formed a cornerstone of modern duty-based ethics",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Ethics",
