    },
    {
      "text": "Compound propositions are constructed by applying connectives to atomic or other compound propositions",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Logic",
      "agent": "propositions"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sentences are closed formulas with no free variables , forming the basis for logical assertions",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Logic",
