      "source": "Grokipedia-Logic",
      "agent": "formula"
    },
    {
      "text": "Semantically, HOL admits two primary interpretations: standard (full higher-order) models and Henkin models",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Logic",
      "agent": "admits"
    },
    {
      "text": "Semantically, HOL admits two primary interpretations: standard (full higher-order) models and Henkin models",
