      "source": "Grokipedia-Logic",
      "agent": "logic"
    },
    {
      "text": "Jean-Yves Girard's linear logic (1987) refined classical logic by treating resources (propositions) as consumable, introducing modalities for controlled reuse and influencing concurrency models in computing",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Logic",
      "agent": "linear"
    },
    {
