    },
    {
      "text": "The compatibility ensures that the manifold admits a well-defined notion of smoothness for functions and maps defined on it",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Topology",
      "agent": "compatibility"
    },
    {
      "text": "This structure allows the manifold to inherit the rich analytic properties of Euclidean space locally, while the global topology captures more abstract features",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Topology",
      "agent": "structure"
