    },
    {
      "text": "Embeddings and immersions are key smooth maps in differential topology",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Topology",
      "agent": "immersions"
    },
    {
      "text": "Embeddings and immersions are key smooth maps in differential topology",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Topology",
      "agent": "immersions"
    },
    {
      "text": "An embedding is an immersion that is also a homeomorphism onto its image, ensuring the image is a submanifold without self-intersections",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Topology",
      "agent": "embedding"
    },
    {
      "text": "An embedding is an immersion that is also a homeomorphism onto its image, ensuring the image is a submanifold without self-intersections",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Topology",
      "agent": "embedding"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Whitney embedding theorem states that every smooth n -manifold M M M admits a smooth embedding into R 2 n \\mathbb{R}^{2n} R 2 n",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Topology",
      "agent": "whitney"
    },
    {
