    {
      "text": "Doering achieved a formal total synthesis of quinine, starting from 7-hydroxyisoquinoline and advancing to d-quinotoxine, an established intermediate convertible to the antimalarial drug",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Organic_chemistry",
