    },
    {
      "text": "In materials, nonlinearity manifests in optical phenomena driven by intense laser fields, while in plasmas and relativistic contexts, it influences wave propagation and particle creation",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Electromagnetism",
      "agent": "materials"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brahe himself favored a geo-heliocentric hybrid model, with Earth stationary and planets orbiting the Sun, which in turn circled Earth",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Astronomy",
