      "agent": "proponents"
    },
    {
      "text": "While proponents argue such controls mitigate external threats and protect domestic interests, critics contend they fragment the global network and stifle information exchange",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "while"
    },
    {
      "text": "Complementary initiatives, such as the 2022 Data Act and cloud sovereignty pushes, aim to reduce dependence on non-EU providers like U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "complementary"
    },
    {
