      "agent": "trade"
    },
    {
      "text": "These services rely on protocols that segment content into small chunks for adaptive bitrate streaming, adjusting quality based on network conditions to minimize buffering",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "services"
    },
    {
      "text": "Audio streaming paralleled this, with services like Spotify launching in 2008, capturing market share through personalized algorithms and vast catalogs",
