    {
      "text": "These services facilitate binge-watching and personalized feeds, reshaping consumption from scheduled programming to user-initiated viewing",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "services"
    },
    {
      "text": "Economically, streaming has accelerated cord-cutting, with U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "economically"
    },
    {
      "text": "Economically, streaming has accelerated cord-cutting, with U",
