    {
      "text": "Recent trends indicate escalating frequency and sophistication, driven by state actors, cybercriminals, and supply-chain compromises",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "trends"
    },
    {
      "text": "In 2023, DDoS attacks rose 31% year-over-year, averaging 44,000 daily incidents globally, per FBI data",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "year"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ransomware accounted for 17% of attacks in 2022, per IBM's X-Force Index, with costs projected to reach $13",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "ransomware"
    },
    {
