      "text": "0%), reflecting heightened vulnerability in young adults due to unstructured time and academic stress",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "0"
    },
    {
      "text": "Longitudinal data suggest causality flows bidirectionally: predisposing traits like low self-control predict onset, while repeated exposure entrenches patterns via habit formation",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "longitudinal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Critics contend these measures prioritize ex-ante behavioral constraints over market-driven competition, potentially deterring experimental features like algorithmic feeds or app integrations that underpin internet evolution",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "critics"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources aligned with free-market perspectives highlight how such rules export precautionary overreach extraterritorially, affecting U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "sources"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources aligned with free-market perspectives highlight how such rules export precautionary overreach extraterritorially, affecting U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
      "agent": "sources"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources aligned with free-market perspectives highlight how such rules export precautionary overreach extraterritorially, affecting U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Internet",
