    {
      "text": "The rivalry has intensified self-sufficiency efforts, with China accelerating indigenous nano- semiconductor R&D in response, though U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nanotechnology",
      "agent": "rivalry"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rivalry has intensified self-sufficiency efforts, with China accelerating indigenous nano- semiconductor R&D in response, though U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nanotechnology",
      "agent": "rivalry"
    },
    {
      "text": "Early narratives of a \"nanotechnology revolution\" promising exponential societal transformations have moderated, with empirical trends indicating incremental integration rather than paradigm shifts",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nanotechnology",
      "agent": "revolution"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continuing into the 21st century, the 2023 Nobel Prize in Chemistry was awarded to Moungi G",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Chemistry",
      "agent": "continuing"
    },
    {
      "text": "Consequently, gaps persist between transitional series, as in the \" Romer's Gap \" for early tetrapods or abrupt appearances in punctuated equilibria models",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Evolution",
      "agent": "gap"
    },
    {
      "text": "Younger but more robust stromatolites from Australia's Pilbara Craton , around 3",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Evolution",
      "agent": "younger"
    },
    {
      "text": "Younger but more robust stromatolites from Australia's Pilbara Craton , around 3",
