    {
      "text": "Advances in AI integration have expanded capabilities, such as drone swarms for coordinated electronic warfare and strikes, tested in U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "integration"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wearable robotic exoskeletons further augment dismounted soldiers, increasing load-carrying capacity by up to 20-50% and mitigating fatigue during extended marches; the U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "further"
    },
    {
