    {
      "text": "These gains align with findings that robot density correlates with firm-level TFP improvements, robust to controls for endogeneity such as Bartik-style instruments",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "align"
    },
    {
      "text": "Productivity accelerations have also supported wage growth, with robots increasing average wages without net employment displacement in aggregate hours worked",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "accelerations"
    },
    {
      "text": "In emerging economies, robot adoption has amplified productivity more substantially, aiding economic convergence",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "emerging"
    },
    {
      "text": "Broader adoption in manufacturing has lowered unit labor costs\u2014for instance, by 6% in Spanish firms post-robotics integration\u2014fostering reshoring and sustained output growth",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "adoption"
    },
    {
