    {
      "text": "Similarly, SS Innovations adjusted its filing for a soft-tissue surgical robot to Q4 2025, highlighting how iterative refinements demanded by regulators can sideline U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "innovations"
    },
    {
      "text": "Similarly, SS Innovations adjusted its filing for a soft-tissue surgical robot to Q4 2025, highlighting how iterative refinements demanded by regulators can sideline U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
