      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "innovations"
    },
    {
      "text": "Broader economic evidence underscores how over-regulation entrenches barriers, particularly for mobile and public-area robots where liability concerns amplify caution",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Information Technology and Innovation Foundation (ITIF) has recommended U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Robotics",
      "agent": "technology"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Information Technology and Innovation Foundation (ITIF) has recommended U",
