      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "transformers"
    },
    {
      "text": "This deal granted Westinghouse exclusive rights to commercialize the system, positioning the company to compete directly with Edison's DC infrastructure",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "deal"
    },
    {
