    {
      "text": "His Wardenclyffe Tower project, begun in 1901 with $150,000 from J",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "wardenclyffe"
    },
    {
      "text": "Morgan, collapsed by 1905 when funding halted due to Tesla's shifting goals from radio to impractical global wireless power transmission, exemplifying overambition without viable commercialization",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "morgan"
    },
    {
      "text": "Critics attribute this to a profound disinterest in financial prudence, prioritizing visionary pursuits over pragmatic deal-making",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "critics"
    },
    {
      "text": "Personal Life and Character Habits, Celibacy, and Eccentricities Tesla practiced lifelong celibacy, eschewing marriage and romantic entanglements to prioritize his inventive work",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "tesla"
    },
    {
      "text": "No records indicate intimate relationships, and contemporaries described him as a bachelor devoted solely to science",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "relationships"
    },
    {
      "text": "His daily routines emphasized discipline and minimalism to sustain productivity",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "routines"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tesla exhibited pronounced eccentricities, including compulsive behaviors suggestive of obsessive-compulsive disorder, as documented in biographical analyses and his own accounts of mental strains",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "tesla"
    },
    {
      "text": "These traits, while enabling singular focus, contributed to his social isolation and were exacerbated by a documented nervous breakdown around age 30",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "while"
    },
    {
      "text": "These habits reflected his belief in disciplined self-denial for mental clarity, though they underscored eccentricities like demanding 18 napkins per meal for compulsive cleaning rituals",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "habits"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then man's new sense of pity began to interfere with the ruthless workings of nature",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "then"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tesla proposed practical measures including sterilization of the unfit and regulated mating to prevent reproduction by those deemed undesirable",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "tesla"
    },
    {
      "text": "He envisioned a future where mating with the unfit would be as socially taboo as marrying a habitual criminal",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "he"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tesla's advocacy implicitly supported population control through selective breeding rather than numerical limits, focusing on enhancing genetic stock to sustain civilizational progress amid technological growth",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "tesla"
    },
    {
      "text": "No direct statements from Tesla endorse reducing overall population size for resource reasons; his emphasis remained on qualitative improvement to avert decline",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "statements"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tesla's perspective leaned toward a deistic or pantheistic spirituality, emphasizing empirical laws of the universe over dogmatic interpretations, without outright rejection of a higher power",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "perspective"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tesla viewed such deterrents as essential, warning that weaker nations must be empowered to defend themselves to prevent conquest",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "tesla"
    },
    {
      "text": "These connected two- room suites provided modest accommodations in a then-luxurious Art Deco hotel , though Tesla 's circumstances reflected his diminished financial status",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "these"
    },
    {
      "text": "His conditions contrasted sharply with earlier prosperity, underscoring the consequences of prioritizing invention over commercial viability",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "conditions"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immediately following Tesla's death, representatives from the U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "immediately"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immediately following Tesla's death, representatives from the U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
