      "agent": "immediately"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immediately following Tesla's death, representatives from the U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "immediately"
    },
    {
      "text": "The FBI tasked MIT professor John G",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "fbi"
    },
    {
      "text": "The FBI maintained files on Tesla but did not conduct an immediate raid on his safe, contrary to some popularized accounts",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "fbi"
    },
    {
      "text": "In 1891, he patented the Tesla coil (U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "he"
    },
    {
      "text": "In 1891, he patented the Tesla coil (U",
