      "agent": "he"
    },
    {
      "text": "Other decorations included the Order of St",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "decorations"
    },
    {
      "text": "Posthumously, the International Electrotechnical Commission named the SI unit of magnetic flux density the \"tesla\" (T) in 1960, honoring his work on magnetism and electromagnetism",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "posthumously"
    },
    {
      "text": "His induction motor designs form the basis for most modern electric motors, powering industrial machinery, appliances, and electric vehicles today",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "designs"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Tesla turbine, patented in 1913 (U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
      "agent": "tesla"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Tesla turbine, patented in 1913 (U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nikola_Tesla",
