    {
      "text": "Wind energy development contributes to habitat fragmentation through turbine arrays and associated roads, creating barriers that disrupt animal movement and connectivity between ecosystems",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Renewable_energy",
      "agent": "contributes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Additionally, collisions with turbines result in significant wildlife mortality; estimates from U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Renewable_energy",
      "agent": "additionally"
    },
    {
      "text": "Additionally, collisions with turbines result in significant wildlife mortality; estimates from U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Renewable_energy",
