    {
      "text": "Empirical trends indicate rising temperatures have already averted approximately 166,000 deaths net globally through reduced cold exposure",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "indicate"
    },
    {
      "text": "Economic opportunities arise from the opening of Arctic shipping routes due to ice melt",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "arise"
    },
    {
      "text": "Historically, warmer periods such as the Medieval Warm Period correlated with agricultural expansions and Norse settlements in Greenland, underscoring potential societal adaptations to benign warming",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "period"
    },
    {
      "text": "These benefits, while regionally variable, counterbalance some projected adverse effects, emphasizing the need for nuanced assessment beyond predominant negative narratives",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "variable"
    },
    {
      "text": "Agriculture and forestry mitigation focuses on reducing methane from livestock, enhancing soil carbon sequestration, and curbing deforestation",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "agriculture"
    },
    {
      "text": "Policies like subsidies for renewables have accelerated deployment but distorted markets, with U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "policies"
    },
    {
      "text": "Policies like subsidies for renewables have accelerated deployment but distorted markets, with U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "policies"
    },
    {
      "text": "Policies like subsidies for renewables have accelerated deployment but distorted markets, with U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "policies"
    },
    {
      "text": "Policies like subsidies for renewables have accelerated deployment but distorted markets, with U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "policies"
    },
    {
      "text": "Policies like subsidies for renewables have accelerated deployment but distorted markets, with U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "policies"
    },
    {
      "text": "In coastal regions, structural defenses have demonstrated longevity and efficacy",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "defenses"
    },
    {
      "text": "Water management strategies include enhanced storage and efficiency measures",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "management"
    },
    {
      "text": "Economic evaluations underscore adaptation's feasibility over inaction",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "economic"
    },
    {
      "text": "A European Environment Agency assessment found adaptation measures cost-efficient when benefit-cost ratios exceed 1",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "european"
    },
    {
      "text": "A European Environment Agency assessment found adaptation measures cost-efficient when benefit-cost ratios exceed 1",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "european"
    },
    {
      "text": "A European Environment Agency assessment found adaptation measures cost-efficient when benefit-cost ratios exceed 1",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "european"
    },
    {
      "text": "A European Environment Agency assessment found adaptation measures cost-efficient when benefit-cost ratios exceed 1",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "european"
    },
    {
      "text": "A European Environment Agency assessment found adaptation measures cost-efficient when benefit-cost ratios exceed 1",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "european"
    },
    {
      "text": "5, though quantifying avoided damages remains challenging due to baseline uncertainties",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Climate_change",
      "agent": "5"
