      "text": "These constructs, often lipid-based protocells, replicate division and metabolism, paving the way for designer therapeutics",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Cell_(biology)",
      "agent": "often"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prokaryotes encompass the two domains of life, Bacteria and Archaea , which together represent the majority of known cellular diversity on Earth",
