    },
    {
      "text": "Beam measurements may underestimate decays due to intra-beam scattering or angular distribution biases, but refined proton spectroscopy has narrowed but not eliminated the offset",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Neutron",
      "agent": "measurements"
    },
    {
      "text": "New physics proposals include non-standard weak interactions or hidden sectors",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Neutron",
      "agent": "proposals"
    },
    {
      "text": "Another suggests mirror neutrons or dark matter mediators (e",
