      "agent": "sources"
    },
    {
      "text": "D-D reactions yield lower outputs (10\u2075-10\u2078 neutrons per second) but lower neutron energies (2",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Neutron",
      "agent": "reactions"
    },
    {
