    },
    {
      "text": "In radiation protection , neutron quality factors (2\u201320) incorporate this enhanced detriment, reflecting higher stochastic risks per absorbed dose (in Gy ) compared to photons",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Neutron",
      "agent": "neutron"
    },
    {
      "text": "Facilities apply ALARA principles, justifying exposures against benefits and optimizing via site-specific surveys",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Neutron",
      "agent": "principles"
    },
    {
      "text": "Composite shields incorporating boron carbide enhance performance by suppressing secondary gammas from neutron capture",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Neutron",
