      "text": "Prominent SMR examples include NuScale Power's VOYGR, a pressurized water reactor with 77 MWe modules using integral steam generators for compactness; the U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
      "agent": "prominent"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nuclear Regulatory Commission granted standard design approval for this uprated version in May 2025, following earlier certification of a 50 MWe variant in 2020",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
      "agent": "regulatory"
    },
    {
      "text": "Department of Energy funding accelerating prototypes expected by 2028",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
      "agent": "department"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prototypes like China's CFR-600 SFR (600 MWe), operational since 2023, demonstrate breeding ratios above 1",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
      "agent": "china"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prototypes like China's CFR-600 SFR (600 MWe), operational since 2023, demonstrate breeding ratios above 1",
