      "agent": "while"
    },
    {
      "text": "These attributes position nuclear as technically superior for high-density, uninterrupted energy supply, complementing rather than competing with intermittents in hybrid grids",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
      "agent": "position"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cognitive biases, such as the availability heuristic, further entrench these views by prioritizing vivid memories of accidents over statistical safety records",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
      "agent": "cognitive"
    },
    {
      "text": "Media coverage has historically intensified these psychological tendencies through sensational reporting of nuclear incidents, fostering a narrative of inherent peril",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
      "agent": "historically"
    },
    {
      "text": "Such portrayals, often prioritizing dramatic visuals over context, have correlated with dips in public support, as seen in U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
      "agent": "often"
    },
    {
      "text": "Such portrayals, often prioritizing dramatic visuals over context, have correlated with dips in public support, as seen in U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Nuclear_power",
