    {
      "text": "Asymptotic GUTs in SO(10) with one extra dimension propose gradual unification in the ultraviolet limit, where couplings converge non-perturbatively, offering testable signatures in flavor physics",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Physics",
      "agent": "limit"
    },
    {
      "text": "As the quantum excitation\u2014or \"particle\"\u2014of this field, the Higgs boson manifests the field's properties, much like the photon embodies the electromagnetic field",
