      "agent": "masses"
    },
    {
      "text": "Detection of 5mC typically relies on bisulfite sequencing , which converts unmethylated cytosines to uracils while leaving 5mC intact, allowing precise mapping of methylation sites",
      "source": "Grokipedia-DNA",
      "agent": "typically"
    },
    {
