      "source": "Grokipedia-Woman",
      "agent": "developing"
    },
    {
      "text": "Low fertility drives demographic shifts, including rapid population aging and inverted age pyramids, where fewer working-age individuals support a growing elderly cohort",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Woman",
      "agent": "shifts"
    },
    {
