    },
    {
      "text": ", 1-2% non-binary) reflect social/cultural flexibility, not an independent continuum",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Gender_identity",
      "agent": "binary"
    },
    {
      "text": "Country Policies (2025) Country Policy Notes USA Approximately 20 states allow \"X\" markers on driver's licenses or birth certificates",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Gender_identity",
