      "agent": "s"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hewitt released her self-titled third studio album, Jennifer Love Hewitt , on September 3, 1996, through Atlantic Records",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Jennifer_Love_Hewitt",
      "agent": "hewitt"
    },
    {
