      "agent": "album"
    },
    {
      "text": "It peaked at number 80 on the Billboard 200",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Jennifer_Love_Hewitt",
      "agent": "it"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her fourth and final studio album to date, BareNaked , was released on October 8, 2002, by Jive Records",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Jennifer_Love_Hewitt",
      "agent": "barenaked"
    },
    {
