    },
    {
      "text": "The article noted that the term arose from army rations, aligning with Wilson's beef supplies, though it did not explicitly name him",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Uncle_Sam",
      "agent": "article"
    },
    {
      "text": "These documents, preserved in local historical records, provided the basis for later verification efforts but relied on retrospective testimony rather than contemporaneous records",
