      "source": "Grokipedia-Cuban_Missile_Crisis",
      "agent": "liquid"
    },
    {
      "text": "This backchannel commitment hedged against Soviet demands for simultaneous removal, emphasizing future U",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Cuban_Missile_Crisis",
      "agent": "commitment"
    },
    {
      "text": "The bargain's secrecy stemmed from U",
