      "agent": "bargain"
    },
    {
      "text": "These flights captured photographic evidence of missile site dismantling, with initial images by October 29 showing Soviet technicians crating components for shipment",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Cuban_Missile_Crisis",
      "agent": "flights"
    },
    {
      "text": "By November 9, 1962, the last ships carrying medium-range ballistic missiles departed Cuban ports, observed under the ongoing U",
