      "agent": "navy"
    },
    {
      "text": "These deployments underscored the US commitment to coercive diplomacy backed by overwhelming conventional superiority, deterring Soviet escalation while avoiding direct combat initiation",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Cuban_Missile_Crisis",
      "agent": "deployments"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fewer R-14 (SS-5 Skean) intermediate-range missiles, numbering around six, arrived but faced delays in assembly and fueling, limiting their immediate threat to U",
