      "source": "Grokipedia-Cuban_Missile_Crisis",
      "agent": "plans"
    },
    {
      "text": "The perceived Soviet retreat also intensified the Sino-Soviet split, with Chinese leaders denouncing Khrushchev's \"capitulation\" to U",
