    {
      "text": "Strong desire for primary and/or secondary sex characteristics of the other gender",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Gender_identity",
      "agent": "strong"
    },
    {
      "text": "Clustering in pre-existing peer networks suggested contagion-like spread, distinct from childhood-onset dysphoria, with ~80% of cases involving adolescent females without prior childhood history",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Gender_identity",
      "agent": "clustering"
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional states like Ohio, Wyoming, South Carolina, and New Hampshire joined in 2024, affecting an estimated 120,000 transgender youth aged 13-17",
      "source": "Grokipedia-Gender_identity",
      "agent": "additional"
    },
    {
